{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-snowy-zigzags-v6-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "b5b9510ab6831d0a814fcaf8f0fdaf835b01a81e1bb877308c38abf409a097eb",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a87b0b2f779d8d8080ecd57e086e79fc93f0e1f7f6aaf9a2f41cd6d67e29e576",
      "text": "悟空的\n雪地弯弯",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "611031d9c1ba318406d1debb5d50b3b333af5bc49b8221ce0a8e24747c997252",
      "text": "玉兔挥挥手。\n“欢迎你，悟空！”\n“欢迎你，铁扇公主！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "01c3749784297ece8b629e35f3725480df5610cad7fd1fa7054258de467047d9",
      "text": "金箍棒和铁扇子，\n都收进小柜子里。\n穿好雪靴，踩上雪板。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a73ad603d2801567a647a67b54d870fa423ab8b0cbad46755412ac47e4780f7b",
      "text": "“我的脚变长啦！”\n悟空摇摇晃晃，\n两块雪板滑向两边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d72c2d2d75d4a914128f60c945e860a8f6e6d976bb9b066f606190c609d8a0ee",
      "text": "水獭教练检查每顶头盔。\n“先在小缓坡上练习哦。”\n大家认真听。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1bb2a6bc726359e68a2a3719f8d7fe9d7f426152d442d8926f9f4bb627e4f5f8",
      "text": "悟空迈得太快啦。\n扑通！坐进软软的雪里。\n尾巴上顶着一个雪球。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5f3736359ea5121903d7d4edc439e81627f5e52ec2a73bef2fc30ceb02d0e005",
      "text": "铁扇公主坐进软雪里。\n“皇家雪坐垫！”\n她哈哈大笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7a48dbdca3b7768b52d43509a1e98e7ba05b972e8332eb5f97bbb8cf168cd39f",
      "text": "她“唰”地停下来。\n再看看前面的弯道——\n那个弯好大呀。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "510f626f706dc6975d97a25b6e20c90e71f7a704f32a724326959c5cb3ac32e6",
      "text": "悟空弯弯膝盖。\n“小脚，慢一点！”\n他抬头看向坡下。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1edcda2715645b37d663d9ef290f7f1a384c3b54061b816207c6fe34bab36083",
      "text": "教练用小旗标出宽宽的路。\n玉兔在旁边喊：“慢慢来！”\n悟空认真听。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0cee35b3fb6144767af067e7fec3ffa2f306193fa2e367bab9ec87c634573fd9",
      "text": "铁扇公主慢慢呼了口气。\n弯弯膝盖，转个小弯，\n雪板绕过了小旗。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b2f6236b53463e1519a1ffc27bd6c4d70ac4bd5db9fb70576833bb5283642a38",
      "text": "悟空弯弯膝盖，转个弯。\n“慢慢滑。转个弯。停！”\n他停在小旗旁边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9405de8a08fe4447af352a8a90cf39ad95dfc59f2e22ad1e447d8aa7253ab3ca",
      "text": "他们回头看。\n雪地上，两条弯弯的线\n交叉在一起。\n“像两条丝带！”玉兔喊。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dd1aff42e1226fd1d28a573bf408c5765390c26b697e190323344112e9386e4f",
      "text": "三杯暖暖的热可可，\n一碗小鱼饼干。\n吹一吹，小口喝，小口喝。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "90728e8117f10e91c0be95daf25d136d2c1f498d5f8a72d864c94ef0fa1d07e8",
      "text": "“我的小鱼不会滑雪！”\n“我的小鱼会游泳……\n游进我的肚子里！”\n咔嚓，咔嚓。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "eab1e4a9a5ba260d45782d62663f68cea594f14fef74a9e9429878dc504753ae",
      "text": "他们画下弯弯的滑雪路线。\n玉兔添上小小的雪花。\n窗外，雪花轻轻飘。\n屋里，可可还暖暖的。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
